          "stem_markdown": "A student wishes to estimate the proportion, \\(p\\), of students at her college who have exactly one brother. She surveys a random sample of 50 students at her college and finds that 18 of them have exactly one brother. She calculates an approximate \\(\\alpha\\%\\) confidence interval for \\(p\\) and finds that the lower limit of the confidence interval is \\(0.244\\) correct to 3 significant figures.\n\nFind \\(\\alpha\\) correct to the nearest integer.",
